{"pageid":3479,"title":"Version 1.32.0","displaytitle":"<span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Version 1.32.0</span>","revid":15615,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Version_1.32.0\">Version 1.32.0</span></h2>\n<p><b>July 31st, 2023</b>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Added:\">Added:</span></h3>\n<ul><li>Added harvestable <a href=\"/wiki/Kelp\" title=\"Kelp\">Kelp</a> to the water</li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Changes:\">Changes:</span></h3>\n<ul><li>Moved underwater resource regions closer to the beach</li>\n<li>Tutorial storyline has been updated to be more interactive, and less reading</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Rusty_Saw\" title=\"Rusty Saw\">Rusty Saw</a> has been buffed</li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bug_Fixes:\">Bug Fixes:</span></h3>\n<ul><li>Fixed regeneration from water damage</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Healing_Coil\" title=\"Healing Coil\">Healing coil</a> now works in the water</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Version_1.32.1\">Version 1.32.1</span></h2>\n<p><b>July 31st, 2023</b>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bug_Fixes:_2\">Bug Fixes:</span></h3>\n<ul><li>Fixed Mobile Driving</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Version_1.32.2\">Version 1.32.2</span></h2>\n<p><b>July 31st, 2023</b>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Changed:\">Changed:</span></h3>\n<ul><li>Increased weight of <a href=\"/wiki/Sellner_Explorer\" title=\"Sellner Explorer\">Sellner Explorer</a> to help with flinging</li>\n<li>Increased price of all crate variations</li>\n<li>Decreased mobile hotbar UI size</li>\n<li>Nerfed price of <a href=\"/wiki/Kelp\" title=\"Kelp\">Kelp</a> due to it's availability</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260903163736\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.009 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.015 seconds\nPreprocessor visite